      "comment" : "Footer under Focus Step in Bracket Settings. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged: it is the app's name. Must not claim more than the English: no distance is shown or known. On iPad the English names the iPad, and on other devices it says \"device\"; translate each variant. Draft for the Honesty review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
