    "Off: the file doesn't name the lens." : {
      "comment" : "What turning off the lens model costs. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release. Says what the file holds, not what software can infer from it. Draft for the Honesty review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Off: editors can't automatically correct this lens's distortion and vignetting. The RAW's pixels are never corrected either way." : {
      "comment" : "What turning off lens correction instructions costs. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release. Scoped to the RAW: on a lens without RAW the device may correct its processed file. Draft for the Honesty review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Off: nothing is lost. Only written if you enter them." : {
      "comment" : "What turning off the name and copyright costs. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Off: nothing visible changes." : {
      "comment" : "What turning off a metadata item costs: nothing the person can see. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Off: Photos sorts it by the date it was saved instead." : {
      "comment" : "What turning off the date costs. Photos is the system photo library app. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Off: some RAW editors can't choose their color profile for this camera and use the file's own color data instead. The DNG standard requires this item, so nope. writes a generic value instead." : {
      "comment" : "What turning off the exact model costs. RAW and DNG are file format names. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
