      "comment" : "What turning off the time zone costs. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On a lens that can't save RAW, the phone processes the photo before nope. receives it, and nope. can't turn that processing off. The camera marks these lenses Processed, unless you turn off Show Processed Marker in nope.'s settings, and the photo's details always say so." : {
      "comment" : "Issue #80; docs/PRIVACY.md, \"Processing\". \"Processed\" is the marker on the camera and Show Processed Marker the name of nope.'s own switch; use their translations. RAW is a file format name. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English. On iPad the English names the iPad, and on other devices it says \"device\"; translate each variant. Draft for the Honesty review.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
