                  "value" : "On a lens that can't save RAW, the device processes the photo before nope. receives it, and nope. can't turn that processing off. The camera marks these lenses Processed, unless you turn off Show Processed Marker in nope.'s settings, and the photo's details always say so."
                }
              }
            }
