      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "One photo: the RAW with its %@. The %@ is a photo of its own." : {
      "comment" : "In the photo details: the RAW and one copy (first placeholder, such as HEIF) were added to Photos as one photo, and the other copy (second placeholder, such as JPEG) as a photo of its own. States what nope. asked Photos to do. Draft wording for the Honesty review.",
