    "With Manual Controls on, this choice is not used. A shutter you set is used as set. A shutter on Auto is chosen by the camera." : {
      "comment" : "Second paragraph of the Fast Shutter page in Settings. Manual Controls is the name of nope.'s button; use its translation. \"Auto\" is the word on a manual readout; use its translation. Must not claim more than the English. Draft wording for the Honesty review (docs/design/SETTING-SCOPE.md). Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "With standard protection, Apple holds the keys to iCloud Photos. With Advanced Data Protection, only your devices do. Some photo metadata and Shared Albums stay under standard protection." : {
      "comment" : "Claim 11 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md. Advanced Data Protection and Shared Albums are Apple's names: use the names iOS shows in this language. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
