    "Lets Siri, Shortcuts and other assistants on this device use nope.'s actions, such as taking a photo or switching lenses. While this is off, nope. refuses its actions." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the Assistant Access switch in nope.'s Settings. Siri and Shortcuts are Apple's names. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Draft for the Honesty review. Must not claim more than the English.",
